### Variáveis
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3011/api
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6ImpvYW9AZW1haWwuY29tIiwic3ViIjoiOThjNDk0YTMtZThiZC00YjQzLWIxNjQtNTBlZWMxOGFmNGNmIiwicm9sZSI6IkNPUlJFVE9SIiwiaWF0IjoxNzYzMjU3MjU0LCJleHAiOjE3NjMzNDM2NTR9.2xDAHGZm9KrqQL1bNCyP2xfPtWbbi0c86mXtCXHNLIU
@userId = 98c494a3-e8bd-4b43-b164-50eec18af4cf

# Regras: listar, apagar e promover exigem ADMIN; ler e editar, só o próprio
# cadastro (ou ADMIN). Papel não muda pelo PUT /users/:id — corpo com papel
# responde 400.

### 1. Listar todos os usuários (apenas ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Obter usuário por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Atualizar usuário - Apenas nome
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "João Silva Santos"
}

### 3.1. Atualizar usuário - Apenas telefone
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "phone": "11987654321"
}

### 3.2. Atualizar usuário - Atualização completa
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "João Silva Santos",
  "email": "joao.santos@email.com",
  "phone": "11987654321"
}

### 4. Promover usuário para Administrador (apenas ADMIN)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/promote
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "targetRole": "ADMIN"
}

### 4.1. Promover usuário (sem especificar role - usa ADMIN por padrão)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/promote
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}

### 5. Deletar usuário (apenas ADMIN)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
